Package: Rglimclim
Version: 1.5-1
Date: 2026-08-03
Title: A Multisite, Multivariate Weather Generator Based on Generalised Linear Models
Authors@R: person("Richard E.", "Chandler", role=c("aut", "cre"),
             email="r.chandler@ucl.ac.uk")
Author: Richard E. Chandler [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Richard E. Chandler <r.chandler@ucl.ac.uk> 
Depends: R (>= 4.4)
Description: Modelling and simulation of daily multi-site time series, 
 based on generalised linear models and designed in particular for 
 climatological downscaling applications.
